{% comment %}
  Pre-payment waiting page for credit-card orders whose save runs async
  (large carts: the submit response has no hosted_page_url yet). The URL
  query carries `?order_id=...` only. checkout.js subscribes via Pusher
  (`window.__AICO_PUSHER__`, emitted by the layout when the backend has
  Pusher configured) to `AicoShopOrderCreatedEvent` for that order; the
  event's `url` is the Adyen hosted payment page and the shopper is
  redirected there. Without Pusher it polls /checkout/payment-status,
  whose response carries `hosted_page_url` once the order is saved.
  Only URL-less events/orders go straight to /checkout/thank-you.
{% endcomment %}

<main class="aico-checkout-processing"
      x-data="aicoCheckoutProcessingPage"
      x-init="init()">
  <div class="aico-page-container aico-checkout-processing-inner">
    {%- comment -%}
      One card, two states — the same spinner → status medallion as the
      thank-you page (see thank_you.liquid for the geometry notes): the
      sweeping orange arc runs while we wait for the Adyen round-trip, and
      a payment-session failure flips `is-failed`, which hands the SAME
      circle over to the orange warning disc (aico-ty-status--warn pop)
      while the failure copy rises in underneath. No order was placed,
      nothing was charged, the cart is intact — the button leads back to
      the checkout to retry.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="aico-checkout-processing-card"
         :class="{ 'is-failed': failed }"
         :aria-busy="failed ? 'false' : 'true'">
      <div class="aico-ty-status" aria-hidden="true" :class="{ 'aico-ty-status--warn': failed }">
        <svg class="aico-ty-status-svg" viewBox="0 0 52 52" focusable="false" role="presentation">
          <circle class="aico-ty-status-track" cx="26" cy="26" r="24"/>
          <circle class="aico-ty-status-spin" cx="26" cy="26" r="24"/>
          <circle class="aico-ty-status-ring" cx="26" cy="26" r="24"/>
          <circle class="aico-ty-status-disc" cx="26" cy="26" r="24"/>
          <path class="aico-ty-status-check" d="M14.1 27.2l7.1 7.2 16.7-16.8"/>
          <circle class="aico-ty-status-warn-disc" cx="26" cy="26" r="24"/>
          <path class="aico-ty-status-warn-triangle" d="M26 15.4 38.4 36.6 13.6 36.6 Z"/>
          <path class="aico-ty-status-warn-bang" d="M26 22.6V29.4"/>
          <circle class="aico-ty-status-warn-dot" cx="26" cy="33.1" r="1.45"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1 class="aico-checkout-processing-title" aria-live="polite">
        <span x-show="!failed">{{ 'checkout.processing_page.title' | t }}</span>
        <span class="aico-ty-reveal" x-show="failed" x-cloak>{{ 'checkout.processing_page.failed_title' | t }}</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="aico-checkout-processing-body" x-show="!failed">{{ 'checkout.processing_page.body' | t }}</p>
      <p class="aico-checkout-processing-fallback" x-show="!failed && elapsed > 30" x-cloak>
        {{ 'checkout.processing_page.fallback' | t }}
      </p>
      <p class="aico-checkout-processing-body aico-ty-reveal" x-show="failed" x-cloak>
        {{ 'checkout.processing_page.failed_body' | t }}
      </p>
      <p class="aico-checkout-processing-back aico-ty-reveal" x-show="failed" x-cloak>
        <a class="aico-button aico-button-primary" href="{{ routes.checkout_url }}">
          {{ 'checkout.processing_page.back_to_checkout' | t }}
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
